{"seq":3,"slug":"infrastructure-as-code","title":"基础设施即代码","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":5,"docCount":15,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.32,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 基础设施即代码 简介\n\n基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code，IaC）是现代云运维的核心实践，它将基础设施的配置与管理转化为可版本控制、可复现的代码，从而实现环境一致性、变更可追踪和自动化交付。IaC 的普及标志着运维工程从手动操作向工程化管理的根本转型。\n\n本手册面向有云平台使用经验的开发者和运维工程师，系统介绍 IaC 的核心理念、主流工具和最佳实践。读者将学会如何用代码定义、管理和演进基础设施，实现高效可靠的自动化运维。\n\n全书共分为四章，涵盖 IaC 的完整实践路径：\n\n第一章**IaC 概念**阐述基础设施即代码的核心原则与价值主张，对比声明式与命令式两种范式的优劣，并讲解 IaC 代码的测试与验证策略。\n\n第二章**Terraform 实践**以业界最流行的 IaC 工具 Terraform 为核心，从基础概念与工作流入手，深入模块化设计与代码复用，再到多团队协作场景下的状态管理。\n\n第三章**配置管理**对比主流配置管理工具的特点与适用场景，以 Ansible 为例展示自动化配置实践，并介绍不可变基础设施的设计理念与实现方式。\n\n第四章**GitOps 工作流**将 Git 引入基础设施运维流程，讲解 GitOps 的核心原则，对比 ArgoCD 与 Flux 两大工具的实践方法，并总结 GitOps 的设计模式与最佳实践。\n\n建议读者从概念理解入手，结合 Terraform 实操建立 IaC 实践基础，再拓展到配置管理和 GitOps 等进阶主题。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"iac-concepts","title":"IaC 概念","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"iac-principles","title":"IaC 核心原则","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-concepts/iac-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"declarative-vs-imperative","title":"声明式与命令式对比","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-concepts/declarative-vs-imperative"},{"seq":3,"slug":"iac-testing","title":"IaC 测试策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-concepts/iac-testing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"terraform","title":"Terraform 实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/terraform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terraform-basics","title":"Terraform 基础与核心概念","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"terraform-modules","title":"Terraform 模块化设计","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-modules"},{"seq":3,"slug":"terraform-state","title":"Terraform 状态管理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/terraform-state"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"configuration-management","title":"配置管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/configuration-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"config-management-overview","title":"配置管理概述与工具生态","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/configuration-management/config-management-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ansible-practice","title":"Ansible 自动化实战","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/configuration-management/ansible-practice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"immutable-infrastructure","title":"不可变基础设施","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/configuration-management/immutable-infrastructure"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"gitops","title":"GitOps 工作流","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/gitops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gitops-principles","title":"GitOps 原则与实践模型","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/gitops/gitops-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"argocd-flux","title":"Argo CD 与 Flux 实战","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/gitops/argocd-flux"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gitops-patterns","title":"GitOps 模式与反模式","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/gitops/gitops-patterns"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"iac-fundamentals","title":"IaC 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terraform-basics","title":"Terraform 基础","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-fundamentals/terraform-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"iac-principles","title":"IaC 原则与实践","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-fundamentals/iac-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"config-management","title":"配置管理工具","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-as-code/iac-fundamentals/config-management"}]}]}